s calculated as the mean percentage of visits for ILI during noninfluenza weeks plus two standard deviations.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"robust regression procedure in which a periodic regression model is applied to the observed percentage of deaths from P&I during the previous 5 years\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}